Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/D-creek/meshcore-toad-gateway
Description: MeshCore TDOA gateway (bridge + portal, unified package)
 Replaces both meshcore-tdoa-gateway-bridge and meshcore-tdoa-gateway-portal
 with a single unified Debian package. Phase 3 packaging collapse: the
 mesh-relay is dropped entirely; the bridge publishes directly to all
 configured brokers.
 .
 The bridge reads USB-attached MeshCore LoRa receivers, parses TDOA-extended
 frames and publishes them to MQTT. The portal provides a web UI for
 configuring per-USB-device MQTT broker fan-out and viewing receiver health.
 .
 Both services run from isolated Python venvs at their existing paths:
   /opt/meshcore-tdoa-gateway-bridge/venv  (bridge, root service)
   /opt/meshcore-tdoa-gateway-portal/venv  (portal, unprivileged service)
 .
 Pure Python; the same .deb installs on amd64, arm64, armhf and armv6.
 The postinst builds both venvs with an OFFLINE wheelhouse so a fresh
 install never requires PyPI access.

