Description: MeshCore TDOA gateway portal
 Web UI for configuring per-USB-device MQTT broker fan-out and viewing
 receiver health (GPS fix, satellite count, PPS lock, timing drift) on
 a Pi-class gateway running multiple LoRa receivers. Pure Python; the
